    "html": "\r\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\r\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\r\n          <span class=\"time\">90 min (then come back often)</span>\r\n          <span class=\"chip\">252 questions</span>\r\n          <span class=\"chip docker\">Docker</span>\r\n          <span class=\"chip k8s\">Kubernetes</span>\r\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\r\n          <span class=\"chip\">System design</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <h1>Question Bank</h1>\r\n        <p class=\"lead\">Every question on this page has a short model answer written the way you would say it out loud, a \"how to answer\" note that shows the shape of a strong reply, and the follow-ups interviewers usually ask next. Filter by level, topic and company, then practise until the answers feel like your own words.</p>\r\n      "
